			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1080" height="432" src="https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n-e1707394260641.jpeg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="" title="306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n" srcset="https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n-e1707394260641.jpeg 1080w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n-e1707394260641-600x240.jpeg 600w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n-e1707394260641-300x120.jpeg 300w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n-e1707394260641-1024x410.jpeg 1024w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/306909636_189274943481188_2146092180779105860_n-e1707394260641-768x307.jpeg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><div class="eltdf-section-title-holder  " >
	<div class="eltdf-st-inner">
					<h2 class="eltdf-st-title" >
				Founded in 1996			</h2>
							<h6 class="eltdf-st-text" >
				Dagny’s Coffee Company is a locally owned coffee house, located in downtown Bakersfield on the corner of 20th and Eye Streets. Bakersfield offers something for everyone, and Dagny’s is definitely the place where it all happens. Walk in the door to the smell of fresh coffee brewing, cookies, cakes and scones baking in the kitchen. Dagny’s was founded in the mid 1990’s and has been serving the Bakersfield community with pride ever since.			</h6>
			</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="eltdf-row-grid-section-wrapper "  ><div class="eltdf-row-grid-section"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1717530231029" ><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="1080" height="720" src="https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n.jpeg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="" title="297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n" srcset="https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n.jpeg 1080w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n-600x400.jpeg 600w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/297518299_1206808180139048_3537807288556117396_n-768x512.jpeg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 20px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Dagny&#8217;s Coffee Shop, nestled in the heart of Bakersfield, has long been a cherished cornerstone of the community. Known for its warm ambiance and the rich aroma of freshly brewed coffee, Dagny&#8217;s is more than just a place to grab a cup of joe—it&#8217;s a gathering spot where neighbors connect, stories are shared, and friendships flourish.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 23px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="1080" height="720" src="https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n.jpeg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="" title="286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n" srcset="https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n.jpeg 1080w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n-600x400.jpeg 600w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://www.dagnyscoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/286451795_132408249449693_6155511734187196215_n-768x512.jpeg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 20px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div class="flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full">
<div class="min-h-&#091;20px&#093; text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words &#091;.text-message+&amp;&#093;:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7e7dbf40-3bb1-4499-8bda-fabf72f228e5">
<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-&#091;3px&#093;">
<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark">
<p>Over the years, it has become a symbol of local culture, hosting art shows, poetry readings, and live music that reflect the vibrant spirit of our town. Regulars and newcomers alike find solace in the welcoming environment, where the baristas know your name and your favorite order.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

		</div>
